F568                          IF   FAST*(1-CHECKED)   
F568                             ; a-z, unchecked: a variable followed by @ or ! is fetched or stored in the
F568                             ; same step; otherwise its address is pushed, and the character after it,
F568                             ; read already, is dispatched from A or Y.
F568   A0 00        FVA:      LDY   #0   ; a
F56A   B1 00                  LDA   (IP),Y   
F56C   C9 40                  CMP   #"@"   
F56E   F0 22                  BEQ   fvaf   
F570   C9 21                  CMP   #"!"   
F572   F0 23                  BEQ   fvas   
F574   CA                     DEX      ; not @ or !: push the address
F575   CA                     DEX      
F576   A0 40                  LDY   #40h   
F578   94 00                  STY   0,X   
F57A   A0 04                  LDY   #>LET   
F57C   94 01                  STY   1,X   
